{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33337","headline":"和王侍中谒张恶子庙 · 萧遘","name":"和王侍中谒张恶子庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青骨祀吴谁让德，紫华居越亦知名。\n未闻一劒传唐主，长拥千山护蜀城。\n斩马威棱应扫荡，截蛟锋刃俟昇平。\n酇侯爲国亲箫鼓，堂上神筹更布兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧遘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}